show "white70.png" 0.5:0.5 0.5:0.5 2000:960 fade(0.05,linear) normal

wait 0.05
hide "white70.png" fade(4,linear)

wait 0.85

move "catastrophe/cat_6_1_2.jpg" -50:25 5 outquad

wait 0.6

play "catastrophe_impact_a.ogg" 1

wait 1

say "A shard of glass flickers beside my face. I can see that Saya will be there—
too late. She is already before me and has grasped my skull, glaring enraged.
She pushes my forehead back and raises her blade."

show "black.png" 0.5:0.5 0.5:0.5 2000:960 fade(0.05,linear) normal
show "catastrophe/cat_6_5.jpg" 0.5:1 0.5:1 1:1 fade(4,linear) normal
wait 0.1 clear
move "catastrophe/cat_6_5.jpg" 0:80 0.4 sineout

wait 0.2

play "sword_stab_fire.ogg" 1

wait 0.2

move "catastrophe/cat_6_5.jpg" 10:0 0.05 linear
wait 0.05
move "catastrophe/cat_6_5.jpg" -30:0 0.05 linear
wait 0.05
move "catastrophe/cat_6_5.jpg" 30:0 0.05 linear
wait 0.05
move "catastrophe/cat_6_5.jpg" -20:0 0.05 linear
wait 0.05
move "catastrophe/cat_6_5.jpg" 15:0 0.05 linear
wait 0.05
move "catastrophe/cat_6_5.jpg" -5:0 0.05 linear

wait 1

move "catastrophe/cat_6_5.jpg" 0:60 6 sineout

say "I lift both my hands, and both are pierced swiftly by glass.
She thrusts her sword through my gut, and the tornado of energies
that it has swallowed run rampant throughout me."

show "white40.png" 0.5:0.5 0.5:0.5 2000:960 fade(12,linear) normal

say "I groan. This... This... horrid SPLITTING...
Were I... Were I not... a god, I might—
...!? What—!?"

move "catastrophe/cat_6_5.jpg" -10:0 0.05 linear
wait 0.05
move "catastrophe/cat_6_5.jpg" 30:0 0.05 linear
wait 0.05
move "catastrophe/cat_6_5.jpg" -30:0 0.05 linear
wait 0.05
move "catastrophe/cat_6_5.jpg" 20:0 0.05 linear
wait 0.05
move "catastrophe/cat_6_5.jpg" -15:0 0.05 linear
wait 0.05
move "catastrophe/cat_6_5.jpg" 5:0 0.05 linear

say "Saya makes to withdraw her blade. She grips my skull more fiercely.
She plainly intends to have my head by that blade's warped edge.
But I can see; I can see."

hide "white40.png" fade(0.2,linear)
hide "catastrophe/cat_6_5.jpg" fade(0.2,linear)

unload_textures
wait 0

show "catastrophe/cat_6_2.jpg" 1:0 1:0 0.7:0.7 fade(8,linear) normal
wait 2 clear
show "2black.png" 0.5:0.5 0.5:0.5 2000:960 fade(3,linear) normal

say "I can see, and feel, that in the hallowed halls of my domain
the most precious thing is fading.
Suddenly... but not by \"chance\"."

play "catastrophe_teleport_b.ogg" 1

say "I hold Saya's wrist firm. She winces and wrenches her arm from my grasp,
letting her sword and my skull go before quickly vanishing."

say "I begin to quell the rampant will trying to rip my body apart.
Focused...
For something—something... more important than this fight has come to my eyes."

show "catastrophe/cat_6_4_1c.jpg" 1:0.5 1:0.5 1.1:1.1 fade(8,linear) normal

play "drop_to_earth.ogg" 1

say "I drop to the earth, dust erupting all around me. I hold the sword firm in my stomach.
I see a tear in the fabric of everything, as more light vanishes.
I breathe out, and subtly I can feel the flow of God here."

hide "catastrophe/cat_6_4_1c.jpg" fade(4,linear)

play "sword_draw_echo.ogg" 1
stop "cat_cry_mini_part1.ogg" 0.1
stop "battle_chaos_loop.ogg" 0.1

